WEBVTT

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:06.660
I wonder if she was at the school.

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:09.160
She must be a beautiful person.

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:17.700
Sister?

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.830
No, I can't find her.

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:22.850
Then let's look for her together.

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:26.570
My name is Lily White.

00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:28.060
What's your name?

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:36.380
"Lily Oneechan?"

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:39.700
"Nothing."

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:41.580
"Let's find Onee-san together."

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:45.600
"Yes!"

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:53.810
"Did I overdo it?"

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:29.800
I hid my feelings

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:52.820
I'm sorry.

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:09.480
I'll see you next time.

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:40.150
It seems that my little sister took care of you.

00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:43.350
No, no, Tiana-chan was a very good girl.

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:46.860
Once again, I'm Ariane Orgren.

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:49.130
My name is Lily White.

00:02:49.130 --> 00:02:51.520
You say "Lily-san", don't you?

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:53.250
Yes.

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:59.600
Shall I ask you directly?

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:03.860
You're not one of our students, are you?

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:05.570
No, I'm...

00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:09.700
You're a good student, aren't you, Ariane-sama?

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:12.870
I'm the one who takes care of everything.

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:15.280
So which school are you from?

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:17.680
I won't run away or hide.

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:20.350
You should be honest, too.

00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:22.850
Yes, I'll do that.

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:25.960
I'm sorry for fooling you.

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:28.560
I'm Ray White from Arnold Magical School.

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:29.510
Nice to meet you.

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:32.980
Is something wrong?

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:35.200
You...

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:38.960
Is that so?

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:40.960
...and the way she moves her muscles, she's a woman!

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:42.740
And her voice!

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:48.210
This is an inside code and a little magic application.

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:51.500
And a spirit law.

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:55.990
I think it's the name of the first Ordinary in the school.

00:03:55.990 --> 00:03:57.970
Rumor has it that it has high fighting skills.

00:03:57.970 --> 00:03:59.840
Don't tell me you're going to this school.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.760
Rumor has it that you're a little shy.

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:08.200
You have such a big gap between your voice and your words, it's driving me crazy.

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:14.640
I'm a little embarrassed, but it doesn't change the fact that you're my sister's benefactor.

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:24.130
In return for not doing anything to thank me, I'll grant you the title of "Orgre Naore", which is the title of a "king".

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:33.430
Thank you for your suggestion, Miss Orgren.

00:04:33.430 --> 00:04:36.690
Please call me Ariane.

00:04:36.690 --> 00:04:39.930
Are you sure? We've only just met.

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:41.400
It's special.

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:42.510
Sorry.

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:44.280
I want you to call me Rei.

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:47.600
Nice to meet you again, Rei.

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:50.090
It's me, Ariane.

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:54.000
Um, could you put your voice back?

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:55.960
I think that cap...

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:57.330
Yeah.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:58.380
Understood.

00:05:01.470 --> 00:05:11.570
Yaaaah!

00:05:11.570 --> 00:05:22.560
Well done, Ariana.

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:31.890
You're welcome.

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:40.080
Tiana Zhou is a very good girl.

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:44.740
In the future, she will grow up to be a beautiful and popular person like you.

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:47.020
Ah, what's wrong?

00:05:47.020 --> 00:05:49.290
It's nothing.

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:52.240
Do you always say that to women?

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:56.080
Women are educated to be praised anyway.

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:59.860
You really have changed.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.700
Is that so?

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:03.470
Are you not going out?

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:05.070
To Magix Chevalier.

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:06.640
I have some business to attend to.

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:09.220
I am currently working as a manager,

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:12.450
but I'm also training my friends along the way.

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:15.210
Your friends?

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:17.670
Amelia.

00:06:17.670 --> 00:06:18.730
Amelia...

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:20.380
That Amelia Rose?

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:21.710
Yes.

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:24.510
Then, I have to go to this academy for her?

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:25.720
That's right.

00:06:25.720 --> 00:06:30.000
I have a friend like you, Elia.

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:33.240
She will become stronger.

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:36.190
She will be the one to win the newbie battle.

00:06:36.190 --> 00:06:40.440
Ariane will get to know the taste of defeat.

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:45.290
I'm looking forward to it.

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:50.420
She's late.

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:02.730
Are you okay?

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:06.060
I...

00:07:06.060 --> 00:07:10.070
Are you not hurt?

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:12.160
What's wrong?

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:13.540
I'm fine!

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:23.030
It's most important that your white skin is healed.

00:07:23.030 --> 00:07:25.430
Then, I'll take this.

00:07:35.370 --> 00:07:37.170
My name is Lily White.

00:07:37.170 --> 00:07:38.450
Lily...

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:43.030
What's your name?

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:46.610
Bradley.

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:49.110
Are you Rebecca's little sister?

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:51.700
Do you know my older sister?

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:52.730
Yes.

00:07:52.730 --> 00:07:55.230
I'm very grateful to Rebecca-senpai.

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:59.630
I was wondering if I should enter this school, but I've decided!

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:04.260
If you are here, I will definitely enter! Until next year!

00:08:04.260 --> 00:08:07.620
Is that so?

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:26.180
Well then, I'm sorry to leave. I look forward to seeing you again.

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:27.180
Omenia-chan.

00:08:27.180 --> 00:08:30.000
Oh, thank you.

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:33.560
Ameiria-kun Reihei! You're doing well!

00:08:33.560 --> 00:08:35.740
What the hell!?

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:41.430
Elisa and Clarice, good work too!

00:08:41.430 --> 00:08:44.950
But Ameiria-kun Reihei, don't lose your concentration.

00:08:44.950 --> 00:08:48.340
This voice... is it Rei-kun?

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:48.990
Eh?

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:51.550
Why is Rei's voice coming from the beautiful girl...?

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:55.040
Ah, sorry. I'm on my way back from the mission.

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:55.730
It's me.

00:08:55.730 --> 00:08:56.820
Oh...

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:10.140
It looks like you're having fun today.

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:11.870
That's right!

00:09:11.870 --> 00:09:16.990
That training really is hell.

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:19.560
I-I'm fine!

00:09:19.560 --> 00:09:20.710
It's okay.

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:26.040
Master is a good person.

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:27.610
Have you grown taller again?

00:09:27.610 --> 00:09:30.000
I always say it, but I haven't grown taller.

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:34.330
I see. So, are they like that?

00:09:34.330 --> 00:09:39.220
Yes. They are irreplaceable friends made at the academy.

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:44.980
My name is Eddie Armstrong. I'm in the same class as Ray and we get along well.

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:48.680
I'm Lydia Ainsworth. But...

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:51.080
Oh, you're big.

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:53.310
Do you understand?

00:09:53.310 --> 00:09:57.680
I want you to continue to cheer me up and become a good friend of Ray.

00:09:57.680 --> 00:09:58.770
Of course.

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:08.980
It's huge?

00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:10.590
In another sense.

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:12.300
Yes.

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:14.300
The natural part is also a high point.

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:28.950
Here.

00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:47.920
You want to become a hunter, don't you?

00:10:47.920 --> 00:10:50.620
I know a member of the Cleveland family.

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:52.860
I've been consulted before.

00:10:52.860 --> 00:10:56.960
Is that so?

00:10:56.960 --> 00:11:00.000
I'm a Platinum Hunter.

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:04.050
Unfortunately, this is what she looks like right now.

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:08.660
On that note,

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:14.490
there is no reason to not be a hunter because you are a daughter of a nobleman and a woman.

00:11:14.490 --> 00:11:18.320
The important thing is to take that step.

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:25.960
I'm Amelia Rose. I've been looking for you.

00:11:25.960 --> 00:11:29.270
Oh, we've met at the party a few times, haven't we?

00:11:29.270 --> 00:11:29.860
Yes.

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:32.050
I have something else to tell you.

00:11:32.050 --> 00:11:33.070
Follow me.

00:11:33.070 --> 00:11:34.460
Huh?

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:38.220
Yes.

00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:41.090
Mr. Ray.

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:42.910
Can I help you?

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:50.350
I heard some interesting information.

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:54.850
There's a move on the emperor's dead god.

00:11:54.850 --> 00:11:55.800
Grim Reaper?

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:59.970
What did the assassination organization of the Ewell Empire do?

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:04.520
I'm not sure, but I'm worried about the timing.

00:12:04.520 --> 00:12:07.650
Magik's Chevalier?

00:12:07.650 --> 00:12:11.680
Yes. That tournament will be held by a powerful noble.

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:13.910
Please keep it in your heart, Rei-sama.

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:14.990
Understood.

00:12:14.990 --> 00:12:19.600
It seems you're worried, Amelia Rose.

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:22.510
Um, what is it?

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:25.490
It's a letter from Rei.

00:12:25.490 --> 00:12:30.000
At first it was just an emergency report, but what's going on lately?

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.600
So-so, right?

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:34.720
So-so, you say...

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:40.560
I know you're hiding something in your heart, but I don't know if you should step into it.

00:12:41.930 --> 00:12:43.360
You know the past of Rei, right?

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:45.010
Y-Yes.

00:12:45.010 --> 00:12:47.180
He has talent.

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:50.610
He's the world's best magician who surpasses me, Yu.

00:12:50.610 --> 00:12:56.920
I taught him the knowledge of magic as much as I could, but there's one thing I couldn't teach him.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:13:00.000
It's the human heart.

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:08.370
When we first met, Rei was a kid who gave up everything in this world.

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:12.650
It took time, but he gradually regained his feelings.

00:13:12.650 --> 00:13:17.720
But after all, we were the only ones around him.

00:13:17.720 --> 00:13:20.520
So I recommended him to go to school.

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:27.030
There, I wanted him to make a person's heart an important friend.

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:29.310
And today, you guys came.

00:13:30.570 --> 00:13:35.780
Rei is worried about you, and she feels your fear in her heart.

00:13:35.780 --> 00:13:38.560
I'm happy about that, and I can't help it.

00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:40.370
Lydia-san...

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:45.580
Amelia Rose, I don't know what's in your heart.

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:48.250
No one knows, except for you.

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:52.520
It's your freedom to keep it a secret for the rest of your life.

00:13:52.520 --> 00:14:00.000
But if you wish to change, rely on your friend, rely on her.

00:14:01.530 --> 00:14:09.060
Alright, you guys! Let's all get changed into swimsuits!

00:14:09.060 --> 00:14:11.520
Oh, I've been waiting for this!

00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:14.280
Let's go swimming, Roy!

00:14:14.280 --> 00:14:21.120
Well, I had fun today.

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:23.140
Thank you for inviting me.

00:14:23.140 --> 00:14:25.700
I'm glad you're happy.

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:30.000
Lilia was a good person, and Kara's cooking was good, too.

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:32.180
You don't need to say that!

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:37.050
But from then on, when Lee-san and Carol came,

00:14:37.050 --> 00:14:47.730
that was amazing.

00:14:47.730 --> 00:14:53.840
Ray, I wrote a letter to you about what you should do to Amelia.

00:14:53.840 --> 00:14:58.300
Do what you can for her like I've done.

00:14:58.300 --> 00:15:00.000
Do it in your own way.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:05.160
I understand, Master.

00:15:05.160 --> 00:15:08.130
All right! All of you are here!

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:09.910
The day has finally come.

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:13.570
Ameliya training soldier, you will receive the greatest gift.

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:14.360
Ranger!

00:15:14.360 --> 00:15:19.590
From now on, the Ainsworth Boot Camp's final test will be held!

00:15:19.590 --> 00:15:20.390
Ranger!

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:24.440
In the blink of an eye, I will give you this Ranger's flag!

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:30.000
I will scatter the roses on my chest!

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:34.970
Don't worry. I won't let go of my abilities.

00:15:34.970 --> 00:15:40.120
Amelia, I believe in your strength.

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:41.970
Rui...

00:15:41.970 --> 00:15:49.130
Let's start the test!

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:50.040
Denshin!

00:15:50.040 --> 00:16:00.000
Well then, I've welcomed you to Magikus Shibariye this year as well, but you're not here right now.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:06.280
In order to obtain the glory of being the student's strongest magician, we have won.

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:14.720
If you want to master magic, not only talent and effort, but also an environment where you can connect with others will become an important element.

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:18.860
This tournament will be a big win for you.

00:16:18.860 --> 00:16:22.040
I want you to do your best.

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:26.050
Here, I declare the opening of Magix Chivalry!

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:38.920
Amelia

00:16:38.920 --> 00:16:40.330
Ariane

00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:44.150
It's been a while since we've talked like this

00:16:44.150 --> 00:16:46.920
Yeah, you're right

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:49.710
Amelia, you've changed a little

00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:52.980
Have I?

00:16:52.980 --> 00:16:54.800
I guess I wasn't good enough for you

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.020
I'm waiting for you in the finals.

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:04.790
Yes, let's meet in the finals.

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:13.940
Magix Chevalier's new match is in a blink of an eye, the semi-final.

00:17:13.940 --> 00:17:20.080
I'm Dina Sera, and I'll continue the commentary with Carol Caroline.

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:21.030
Kyupi!

00:17:21.030 --> 00:17:23.650
Now, I'd like to introduce the players.

00:17:23.650 --> 00:17:29.980
Mercurial Magic School's employee, Jilal.

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:39.950
Ameliya Rose

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:50.370
I will be the judge.

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:52.540
I, Abby Garnett, will be in charge.

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:54.540
I will be the one to make the opponent fall to the ground,

00:17:54.540 --> 00:17:56.540
or the one to make the rose of my heart scatter.

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:59.760
Also, I will be the one to judge whether or not I can fight anymore.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:03.080
In that case, let's call the match over at this point.

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:04.080
You two, too.

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:05.510
Yes!

00:18:05.510 --> 00:18:06.510
Come at me!

00:18:06.510 --> 00:18:09.070
The match begins!

00:18:17.340 --> 00:18:23.290
Huh?

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:24.440
That's enough!

00:18:24.440 --> 00:18:28.140
The winner is Amelia Rose!

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:29.140
The match is over!

00:18:30.190 --> 00:18:34.470
It was a perfect hit with the magic of the 8th round!

00:18:34.470 --> 00:18:36.640
What a great delay!

00:18:36.640 --> 00:18:43.390
Ameliya-chan put the magic on the ground as soon as the game started!

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:46.280
After that, she lured the prey and...

00:18:46.280 --> 00:18:48.440
Tsukkyuu!

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:52.900
It's a high-intensity magic, but Ameliya-chan is amazing!

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:53.900
All right!

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:56.930
Amazing! Ameliya-chan is winning!

00:18:56.930 --> 00:18:59.670
I'm sure she's going to win!

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:03.140
Ray, where are you going?

00:19:03.140 --> 00:19:05.480
It's an operator's job.

00:19:05.480 --> 00:19:17.090
It's time, Albert.

00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:20.320
I see.

00:19:20.320 --> 00:19:27.880
I pray for your health.

00:19:27.880 --> 00:19:30.000
Okay.

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:31.380
I'll be back.

00:19:31.380 --> 00:19:46.280
Now, the match between Liam Magician, Arianne Orgren, and Arnold Magician, Albert Allium, will begin!

00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:53.340
The match begins!

00:19:53.340 --> 00:19:53.840
Tch!

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:55.200
Uwaaaaaaah!

00:19:55.200 --> 00:19:58.050
Eh!

00:19:58.050 --> 00:19:58.550
Ah!

00:19:58.550 --> 00:19:58.960
Uwaaaaaaah!

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:04.740
It's a match! It's a match of power!

00:20:04.740 --> 00:20:15.960
It's a spectacular development!

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:19.870
Are you saying that you are the daughter of the three great nobles of the Orgren family?

00:20:19.870 --> 00:20:21.030
That's right!

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:21.920
Haru...

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:28.070
You don't admit defeat?

00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:30.000
It's dangerous from now on.

00:20:30.510 --> 00:20:33.370
Yeah, I know.

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:37.460
If I were you, I would have given up long ago.

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:39.050
But...

00:20:39.050 --> 00:20:42.740
People who realize things can do it again, no matter how many times they have to.

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:46.800
You have no choice but to find the answer that you're looking for.

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:49.860
My heart won't accept defeat!

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:59.380
Take this!

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:40.700
The blue sky was so beautiful today.

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:44.010
Are you serious?

00:21:44.010 --> 00:21:45.490
With Amelia...

00:23:26.360 --> 00:23:28.380
There's also a sad night.

00:23:28.380 --> 00:23:30.000
I know.

